I have some time since I'm on vacation this week and I started a new
tourist character on my mom's computer.  The neat thing about nethack
is that it is still fun even if you know how to "win" the game.  I've
had a heck of a time keeping the character alive (my 2nd character
really).  I keep losing pets and I write the E word and rest up to get
healthy and then have a level filled with monsters.

But, I learned a lot of new things.  I've never thrown multiple daggers
before - not sure why - but that is fun.  I used almost all the flashes
of my camera and wrote the E word many times.

Now I'm in minetown and level 10 exp and am moving towards being ok.
Still only ac -2, no reflection, no MR.  So, I'm not out of the woods.

Anyway, my only point was to say it is fun that the game is still fun.
And I haven't even tried to ascend with a conduct yet, so that is still
out there.

